1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/fosa/fosa-ch13","children":["FOSA丨13丨基于服务的架构"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],"$undefined",["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"架构设计"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"FOSA丨13丨基于服务的架构"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本篇通过回答《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》第十三章的课后思考题，深入探讨基于服务的架构中服务数量的设计考量、数据库分解策略与变更管理机制、领域服务的容器化部署模式，以及基于服务架构的特性支持分析、弹性限制因素和架构量子扩展方案，帮助理解基于服务架构的核心设计原则和实施要点，提升架构师在构建分布式系统时的架构选择能力和服务化设计水平。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-07-17T10:30:00.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/07/17"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","2,199"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":["本系列文章通过逐章回答",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":13,"offset":12},"end":{"line":1,"column":52,"offset":51}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":12,"offset":11},"end":{"line":1,"column":102,"offset":101}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》"}],"（下文简称 FOSA）一书中的课后思考题，来深入理解书中的核心概念和理论，从而提升我们的软件架构设计能力。本篇为",["$","u","u-0",{"children":"第十三章"}],"内容。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"本章的课后题是："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"How many services are there in a typical service-based architecture?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"在一个经典的基于服务的架构中通常有多少个服务？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Do you have to break apart a database in service-based architecture?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"在基于服务的架构中，你是否必须将数据库进行拆分？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Under what circumstances might you want to break apart a database?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"在什么场景下你会对数据库进行拆分？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What technique can you use to manage database changes within a service-based architecture?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"在基于服务的架构中，你会使用什么样的技术来管理数据库变更？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Do domain services require a container (such as Docker) to run?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"领域服务需要在容器（如 Docker）中运行吗？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-5",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Which architecture characteristics are well supported by the service-based architecture style?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"基于服务的架构在哪些架构特性表现很优异？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-6",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Why isn’t elasticity well supported in a service-based architecture?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"为什么基于服务的架构的架构弹性不是很好？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-7",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"How can you increase the number of architecture quanta in a service-based architecture?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"在基于服务的架构中，你如何增加架构量子的数量？"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-0",{}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"简介","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#简介","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#简介"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"简介","position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":4,"offset":1048},"end":{"line":32,"column":6,"offset":1050}}}]},"children":"简介"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"在软件架构的演进光谱中，如果说单体（Monolith）和微服务（Microservices）是两个广为人知的端点，那么基于服务的架构（Service-Based Architecture, SBA）就是它们之间那个常常被忽略，却又极具现实意义的\"务实中间派\"。它既非庞大到笨拙，也非精细到繁杂，为许多成长中的系统提供了一条平滑的演进路径。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":["SBA 的本质是一种将一个大型的单体应用，","$L8"," 的架构风格。SBA 的服务数量通常不多，一般在","$L9","之间。它不像微服务那样追求极致的拆分（可能会有几十上百个服务），而是将应用按照**核心的业务领域（Domain）**进行划分。"]}],"\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d"]}]}],"$L2e","$L2f","$L30"]}],"$L31"]}]]}]}]
